  "description": "Market is finally moving upwards again, after ~4 weeks of chop!",
  "body_html": "<p>Good morning and Happy Friday! This week, after largely sitting on our hands through the market chop the last ~4 weeks of chop, we are finally seeing the broader market…and our positions…make moves. Should we continue to small advances, this will be the time to add new positions, or add to current positions. As always, those updates will come out when, in my opinion, it is time to. <em><strong>Bloom Energy has been our top performer at 26% in just 12 days. </strong></em>Kind of weird, I expected it to do well….but not that well, that quickly! </p><p>We had a pretty big episode of Mid-Week movers this week, with 17 different stocks being reviewed. The top 4 stocks were honestly all winners in my opinion, but I personally settled on picking up 2 of them. </p><p>Here are the Weekly Wrap Up <strong>Highlights</strong> of the week:</p><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stocks-are-breaking-out-again-3-names?r=4z8lgl\">Mid-Week Movers - 17 Stocks narrowed down to 2 Top Stocks</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stocktok-summary?r=4z8lgl\">Current Positions and Pre-Screened Stocks are here now</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://substack.com/@stocktok/note/c-154069583\">The Melt Up is OVER. I believe we are in the Blow-Off Top phase now, and this will be followed by a Melt-Down</a></p></li></ul><p>Pay attention to the “<a href=\"https://open.substack.com/chat/posts/a27b2288-ae6c-4cb6-833a-bfb84d676813\">Quick Notes</a>” section in the chat…I will let you know if I sell Bloom Energy in there first! Questions are welcome in the Main Chat area, which I am typically in there during market hours. </p><p><em><strong>Be sure to disconnect for at least a little</strong></em>. Reading all of the negative economic news…and negative news in general, valid or not…will only leave you frazzled on Monday when you come back to the markets. I am not saying to become desensitized to the news…but take a break. Otherwise, the markets will eat you while you are on tilt. Even I step away, and turn off my own TikTok, to remain fresh and clear headed. </p><p>Hope you all have a great weekend and I will see you bright and early Monday! </p><p>Update 9/12: Congratulations to all my Rigetti Fam. It was a bit of a wait…but we finally broke out and pointing towards uncharted territory!</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!I4Ft!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0e2e27f0-8c0b-49ac-b6c7-9695bc9f80c9_1449x812.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!I4Ft!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0e2e27f0-8c0b-49ac-b6c7-9695bc9f80c9_1449x812.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!I4Ft!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0e2e27f0-8c0b-49ac-b6c7-9695bc9f80c9_1449x812.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!I4Ft!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0e2e27f0-8c0b-49ac-b6c7-9695bc9f80c9_1449x812.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!I4Ft!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0e2e27f0-8c0b-49ac-b6c7-9695bc9f80c9_1449x812.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!I4Ft!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0e2e27f0-8c0b-49ac-b6c7-9695bc9f80c9_1449x812.png\" width=\"1449\" height=\"812\" data-attrs